From 34fcf71c9a10ec82c5ef14bb93fe5b152357b81d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 04:54:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 35/36] Use raw hex QT_VERSION constants inside Q_OBJECT class
 bodies

Runtime symptom: "Object::connect: No such slot
LineEdit::updateClearButton(QString)" -- the slot is correctly declared
under #if QT_VERSION < QT_VERSION_CHECK(5, 0, 0) and the connect() in
the .cpp matches it exactly, so the real compiler is not in question;
moc's own preprocessor is what generates the meta-object data that
connect() looks up at runtime, and moc has a long history of limited
support for function-like macro arithmetic in #if conditions --
QT_VERSION_CHECK(a,b,c) expands to ((a<<16)|(b<<8)|c), which needs
that evaluated correctly, and evidently isn't reliably here.

The standard workaround is to give moc a plain numeric comparison
instead: since QT_VERSION itself is already a hex-encoded integer
constant, "QT_VERSION < QT_VERSION_CHECK(5, 0, 0)" and
"QT_VERSION < 0x050000" are exactly equivalent, but the latter needs
no macro-call evaluation at all.

Moc parses the entire body of any Q_OBJECT class to locate all of its
slots/signals/properties, so a misjudged #if anywhere inside such a
class -- not just ones immediately wrapping a slot -- risks corrupting
its parse of everything after that point. Converted every
QT_VERSION_CHECK(...) occurrence in every Q_OBJECT header in the tree
(12 files, 18 sites) rather than just the one that surfaced at
runtime, since the ones that happen to guard plain data members or
regular methods are just as capable of throwing off moc's parse of the
slots/signals that come after them in the same class body.
---
 src/Gui/LineEdit.h                                      | 8 ++++----
 src/Imap/Model/MailboxModel.h                           | 4 ++--
 src/Imap/Model/MsgListModel.h                           | 2 +-
 src/Imap/Model/SubtreeModel.h                           | 2 +-
 src/Imap/Model/SystemNetworkWatcher.h                   | 2 +-
 src/Imap/Model/ThreadingMsgListModel.h                  | 2 +-
 src/Imap/Model/VisibleTasksModel.h                      | 2 +-
 src/Imap/Model/kdeui-itemviews/kdescendantsproxymodel.h | 2 +-
 src/Plugins/AbookAddressbook/AbookAddressbook.h         | 2 +-
 src/Plugins/ClearTextPassword/ClearTextPassword.h       | 2 +-
 src/Plugins/QtKeyChain/QtKeyChainPassword.h             | 2 +-
 src/UiUtils/Formatting.h                                | 4 ++--
 12 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

